			"notes": "* Updated to 1.20.1\n* Added Absorption as an upgrade modifier to Tinkers' Construct\n  * Grants +1 absorption max per level. Maximum of 5 levels.\n  * Costs 1 golden apple and 1 upgrade slot per level\n  * Works on any worn armor.\n* Added Absorption Max as a defense modifier to Tinkers' Construct\n  * Grants +1 absorption efficiency per level.\n  * Costs 10 steel shards and 1 defense slot per level\n  * Works on any held armor, such as shields or staffs.\n\n## Pull Requests\n* Update to 1.20.1 by @ChiefArug in https://github.com/KnightMiner/SimpleAbsorption/pull/9\n* Tinkers Construct compatibility by @ChiefArug in https://github.com/KnightMiner/SimpleAbsorption/pull/10\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/KnightMiner/SimpleAbsorption/compare/v1.4.0...v1.5.0"
