			"notes": "* Switched Absorption to an attribute system, allows some cool things to be done behind the scenes\n* Chain armor now boosts \"absorption efficiency\", which makes you restore absorption slightly faster and makes it consume less food\n* Added config option to allow enchanting shields with the absorption enchant (enabled by default)\n* Added config option to replace armor with absorption max and to replace armor toughness with absorption efficiency."
